Answer: 3

How many distinct filenames were observed in the links in these emails?
Admittedly, I had to look to the Discord for some assistance here. What I ended up with was:
Email
| where link contains "energy-trends4u.net" or link contains "news-on-industry.com" or link contains "eco-awareness-update.net"
| extend urlpath = tostring(parse_url(link).Path)
| extend urlfilename = tostring(parse_path(urlpath).Filename)
| distinct urlfilename
| count 
Essentially, this will give us the links we need to look at first. Then, we are extending the table to include another column called urlpath. The results in this column will parse out the Path from the URLs, and then convert that information to a string. Then, we are extending again to have a column called urlfilename, which does a similar function but parses out the file names from the URLs. Then, we look for the unique ones and count them.
Answer: 3

